WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:05.087
Where the hell have you been?

00:00:08.006 --> 00:00:09.507
Oh no, take your time, Urs.

00:00:09.507 --> 00:00:12.176
It's only our entire lives
on the line here.

00:00:18.097 --> 00:00:19.348
Ben didn't do it.

00:00:20.975 --> 00:00:22.935
What did you do with the Pento?

00:00:22.935 --> 00:00:24.227
Have you got it?

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:30.191
How can you be sure he didn't?

00:00:30.191 --> 00:00:31.817
Because he ended it Bibi, okay?

00:00:31.817 --> 00:00:32.901
That's how.

00:00:34.194 --> 00:00:35.445
He wouldn’t do that for me.

00:00:35.445 --> 00:00:36.863
I don't know what I was thinking.

00:00:39.573 --> 00:00:40.824
I’ve ruined it all.

00:00:42.617 --> 00:00:43.660
Ugh, Urs.

00:00:45.203 --> 00:00:47.913
Okay, if anyone in this room did it,
we need to say.

00:00:48.789 --> 00:00:50.207
I mean it.

00:00:50.665 --> 00:00:53.334
No one is going to have to
deal with this alone.

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:55.878
We'll close ranks circling.

00:00:56.295 --> 00:00:58.422
It's the only way we can all be protected.

00:01:01.799 --> 00:01:03.009
Urs?

00:01:04.969 --> 00:01:06.970
She was on her own all night.

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:07.971
Who’s to say she didn't?

00:01:07.971 --> 00:01:08.722
Because I didn't.

00:01:08.722 --> 00:01:09.639
Because she didn't.

00:01:09.639 --> 00:01:12.433
Okay, so both of you get
automatically believed

00:01:12.433 --> 00:01:13.684
And I have to provide a bloody alibi?

00:01:13.684 --> 00:01:15.769
She didn't have someone else involved.

00:01:15.769 --> 00:01:17.312
She's a f*cking psycho.

00:01:17.312 --> 00:01:18.104
[Surprised laugh]

00:01:18.104 --> 00:01:19.897
I'm not the one who tried to kill someone

00:01:19.897 --> 00:01:22.232
so my husband didn't discover my affair.

00:01:22.232 --> 00:01:23.692
Would you just stop, okay?

00:01:23.692 --> 00:01:24.151
B*tch!

00:01:24.151 --> 00:01:25.026
Just stop!

00:01:25.026 --> 00:01:26.236
You’re the psycho!

00:01:26.236 --> 00:01:28.696
Where were you, Becka?
I need to know where you were that night.

00:01:28.696 --> 00:01:30.197
Why was there mud on your shoes?

00:01:30.197 --> 00:01:33.575
I got hammered at the pub,
Miss f*cking Marple!

00:01:33.825 --> 00:01:35.827
I was worried you would
do something reckless,

00:01:35.827 --> 00:01:36.953
so I got pissed.

00:01:36.953 --> 00:01:37.787
Taught me well.

00:01:37.787 --> 00:01:39.038
Don't talk to her like that.

00:01:39.038 --> 00:01:40.330
What are you fighting about?

00:01:41.707 --> 00:01:43.166
Um, nothing.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.376
Uh, just politics.

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:50.297
Ever since John Paul died, whenever
I walk into the room, you stop talking.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:51.631
No, we don't.

00:01:51.631 --> 00:01:53.633
What's happened, Grace? Are you okay?

00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:56.302
They did a post-mortem on John Paul.

00:01:56.302 --> 00:01:57.719
My signature is on this.

00:01:57.719 --> 00:01:59.387
Like I agreed to it.

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.140
Those dirty bastards.

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:03.140
Shut up.

00:02:04.058 --> 00:02:05.100
Oh my God.

00:02:07.352 --> 00:02:08.562
You knew about it.

00:02:09.479 --> 00:02:11.522
You knew about the post-mortem.

00:02:13.983 --> 00:02:16.109
Why did they exhume John Paul's body?

00:02:23.657 --> 00:02:25.617
Because they think he was murdered.

00:02:27.702 --> 00:02:29.704
And they think it was one of us
who did it.

00:02:32.581 --> 00:02:33.832
One of you?

00:02:35.583 --> 00:02:37.085
Why would they think that?

00:02:39.628 --> 00:02:40.629
Because they think

00:02:40.629 --> 00:02:42.839
we all had a reason to kill him.

00:02:44.632 --> 00:02:45.591
- And because...
- No!

00:02:45.591 --> 00:02:47.385
Just stop lying to her!

00:02:50.178 --> 00:02:52.305
Because we may not have killed him.

00:02:54.098 --> 00:02:55.891
Jesus, we tried.

00:02:56.559 --> 00:02:58.060
What are you talking about?
What does that mean?

00:02:58.060 --> 00:02:59.352
We tried.

00:02:59.352 --> 00:03:02.980
We wanted John Paul dead, Gracie.

00:03:05.774 --> 00:03:07.567
We were doing it for you.

00:03:08.527 --> 00:03:10.195
We wanted to save you.

00:03:13.114 --> 00:03:15.449
We wanted you and Blánaid to be free.

00:03:15.449 --> 00:03:17.701
[Heavy breaths]

